  "start.welcome": "Hi! I'm RADAR. Tell me what you need, in your own words, and I'll search real providers for it.\n\nFor example:\n- sushi for two in Yerevan tomorrow at 18:00, up to 30,000 AMD\n- train from Frankfurt to Berlin arriving before 14:00 tomorrow\n- notify me when a direct flight Yerevan to Rome drops below EUR 100",
  "start.pick_language": "Choose your language:",
  "start.pick_city": "Which city should I search in by default? Type a city name, or share your location.",
