  "menu.help": "Help",
  "help.text": "Write a request in any language. I separate what you need from what you'd like, search the providers that cover your city, and show where every price and time came from.\n\nUseful follow-ups: \"cheaper\", \"actually Paris\", \"for three\", \"add a balcony\", \"without parking\".\n\n/radars - your monitors\n/settings - language, currency, city\n/location - share your location\n/privacy - what I store",
  "privacy.text": "I store your Telegram id, language, currency, cities you saved, your radars and your recent searches (kept for 30 days). Your location is used only for the search you shared it for and is not kept after the session. Use /forget to delete everything.",
  "forget.confirm": "Delete all your data, including radars? This can't be undone.",
